<title>USA: OMAHA CATTLE $1.00 LOWER - USDA.</title>
<headline>OMAHA CATTLE $1.00 LOWER - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers mostly $1.00 lower, slow. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers: Mainly Choice 2-4 1150-1300 lbs 64.00-65.00, packages 65.25, 10 head 1375 lbs 65.75. Select 61.00-63.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 975-1250 lbs 63.50-65.00. Select 60.00-63.00.</p>
</text>
